126 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 102 0 R
/E (   Its name is Emotion Trigger. This is because I believe video games and animations allow us to experience the emotions we might just feel once in our lifetime. From the sinking sunset in another planet to the memorable friendship you build with different characters you met in all sort of adventures, this ever changing media has offered me so much joy. That is why I would like to share my passion with you. For me, making these games is the most enjoyable game ever. You never know what is waiting for you the next day you wake up and the things you make do connect people together, even though they may speak different languages.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
