<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 106 0 R
/T (Color serves the theme directly: blue represents the ruler's cold, ordered dominance; red represents the danger and unknown of the assassin's illusion, with red and blue light through smoke creating a hazy, immersive look. Editing was the most time-consuming stage, requiring many reshoots; fast cutting and sightline-obscuring camera techniques helped mask transition flaws without sacrificing quality. Technically, Unreal Engine and Level Sequence enabled fast, high-quality real-time rendering, while Tripo generated the goddess statue and Seedance produced the in-scene footage paying homage to The Twilight Zone.)
/E (Color serves the theme directly: blue represents the ruler's cold, ordered dominance; red represents the danger and unknown of the assassin's illusion, with red and blue light through smoke creating a hazy, immersive look. Editing was the most time-consuming stage, requiring many reshoots; fast cutting and sightline-obscuring camera techniques helped mask transition flaws without sacrificing quality. Technically, Unreal Engine and Level Sequence enabled fast, high-quality real-time rendering, while Tripo generated the goddess statue and Seedance produced the in-scene footage paying homage to The Twilight Zone.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
