/P 116 0 R
/T (The initial spark for this project came from watching Kill Bill, combined with my long-standing appreciation for Brutalist architecture. This led to the idea of building a level in a similar aesthetic style. On top of this, I incorporated science-fiction elements, aiming to challenge myself to enrich and diversify the scene.)
/E (The initial spark for this project came from watching Kill Bill, combined with my long-standing appreciation for Brutalist architecture. This led to the idea of building a level in a similar aesthetic style. On top of this, I incorporated science-fiction elements, aiming to challenge myself to enrich and diversify the scene.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
