/Title (Color serves the theme directly: blue represents the ruler's cold, ordered dominance; red represents the danger and unknown of the assassin's illusion, with red and blue light through smoke creating a hazy, immersive look. Editing was the most time-consuming stage, requiring many reshoots; fast cutting and sightline-obscuring camera techniques helped mask transition flaws without sacrificing quality. Technically, Unreal Engine and Level Sequence enabled fast, high-quality real-time rendering, while Tripo generated the goddess statue and Seedance produced the in-scene footage paying homage to The Twilight Zone.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1570 0 R
/Next 1641 0 R
>>
