/Title (The video game Die Hard contains two levels. In the first level, player enters from outside the building, makes their way in from the first floor, and takes an elevator all the way up to the highest level. Portals and other mechanical devices are used to reach different locations. On the second level, i designed a third-person shooter sequence that progresses from top to bottom, set in a confined indoor environment. Players leverage interactive elements \(traps, elevators, cover systems, etc.\) within the level to gain tactical high-ground advantages.)
